<title>MEXICO: Rcentro pays 0.2033 peso per share dividend.</title>
<headline>Rcentro pays 0.2033 peso per share dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican broadcaster Grupo Radio Centro (Rcentro) SA de CV announced on Wednesday it will pay a per share dividend of 0.2033 pesos.</p>
<p>Rcentro said in a statement to the Mexican Stock Exchange that the dividend was equivalent to a total payment of 40 million pesos to be charged against net 1996 earnings and payable for each of 196,733,744 outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The dividend was agreed in a shareholders assembly held March 10, the statement said.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
